  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></math> be positive valued angles (in radian) such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></math>. Define the complex numbers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></msup></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math>. Consider the statements&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math> given below:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>9</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "xOkWq",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> is TRUE and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math> is FALSE",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WdgD8",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math> is TRUE and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> is FALSE",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "iPycP",
      "text": "both <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math> are TRUE",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ZLcE3",
      "text": "both <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math> are FALSE",
      "isCorrect": false,
